Package: orpheus
Title: Contract Intelligence Platform (Phase 1: Ingest and Extraction)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Cathal", "Byrne", email = "cathal470@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Server-side backend for a contract intelligence platform. Ingests
    contract documents, extracts structured instances against an ontology bundle
    using the ontologyDiscoverR discover/populate flow, records provenance and
    human amendments, evaluates versioned conceptR concepts, and exposes the
    result over a Plumber HTTP API backed by a single-writer SQLite store that
    Datasette reads in immutable mode.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
